  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム ZZ』より、特徴的なフォルムと武装を再現した「ガルスJ」がHGで待望の立体化！",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ \", the long-awaited HG \" Gallus J\", which reproduces its distinctive form and armament, is now in 3D form!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ガルスJの特有の武装であるエネルギー・ガンが付属。",
      "en": "• Garrus J's unique weapon energy gun is included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部はモノアイパーツを差し替えて目線移動が可能。",
      "en": "• The head can change the line of sight by replacing the mono eye parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肩部ミサイルハッチはパーツの差し替えでハッチ展開状態を再現可能。",
      "en": "• The shoulder missile hatch can reproduce the hatch deployment state by replacing parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腕はパーツを差し替えることでアーム・パンチ状態を再現できる。",
      "en": "• The arm punch state can be reproduced by replacing the arm parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ビーム・サーベルのグリップはリアスカートに懸架できる。",
      "en": "• Beam saber grip can be suspended from rear skirt."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 股関節軸は軸位置を下げることで脚部の可動範囲が拡大。",
      "en": "• The range of motion of the legs is expanded by lowering the hip joint axis position."
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
    {
